### PHP / Composer
# Composer-managed dependencies. Not tracked: composer.json + composer.lock pin
# exact versions, and tools/build.php excludes vendor/ from the staged copy and runs
# `composer install --no-dev` inside it, so the release artifact is built from
# the lock file, never from this directory.
# Restore a working tree with: composer install
/vendor/*

# EXCEPTION: the ALTCHA widget is vendored by hand, not by Composer (it is an
# npm package, not a PHP one), so nothing can regenerate it from composer.lock —
# tools/build.php copies it straight out of the working tree, checked against the
# hashes pinned in its VERSION file. It must stay tracked.
!/vendor/altcha/

